Description: Provides functions for causal mediation analysis, including
  estimators of total, natural direct and indirect, interventional, controlled
  direct, and path-specific effects. Estimation approaches include regression
  imputation, inverse probability weighting, regression with residuals, linear
  models, multiply robust estimation, debiased machine learning, and
  simulation-based estimation with bootstrap inference. The methods are
  described in Wodtke and Zhou (2026, ISBN:9781009222228) "Causal Mediation
  Analysis", Cambridge University Press.
